# Court witness (2026-10-01 consolidation). Positive fixture: every included component is a typed, slugged, required-classified component.
@prefix dfcm: <https://ggen.dev/ontology/dfcm#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
dfcm:FullChatmanEcosystem dfcm:includesComponent dfcm:WitnessComponent .
dfcm:WitnessComponent a dfcm:Component ; dfcm:slug "witness-component" ; dfcm:required true .
